#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0118 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Within a given value of PARAMCD, there is more than one value of ATPTN for a given value of ATPT
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col ATPTN type=Char
col ATPT type=Char
---
Label A | A
Label B | B
Label A | A
---
